Build a read-only developer change plan over bounded impact evidence

Usage:
  eshu change plan [flags]

Flags:
      --api-key string        API key for authentication
      --base string           Git base ref for local diff derivation
      --env string            Optional environment filter
      --file stringArray      Repo-relative changed file path; repeat for multiple files
      --head string           Git head ref for local diff derivation
  -h, --help                  help for plan
      --intent string         Optional developer intent used to rank and explain plan actions
      --json                  Write the canonical pre-change impact envelope as JSON
      --limit int             Maximum rows per response section (max 100) (default 25)
      --max-depth int         Maximum graph traversal depth (max 8) (default 4)
      --module-id string      Optional Terraform module id
      --offset int            Result offset for content-backed code investigation
      --profile string        Config profile name
      --repo-id string        Repository selector for changed-path lookup
      --repo-path string      Local repository path used to derive --base/--head diffs (default ".")
      --resource-id string    Optional canonical cloud resource id
      --service-name string   Optional service or workload name
      --service-url string    API service URL (overrides config)
      --target string         Optional canonical entity id or exact entity name
      --target-type string    Optional target kind
      --topic string          Optional code topic to scope impact
      --workload-id string    Optional canonical workload id

Global Flags:
      --database string   Temporarily override database backend
  -V, --visual            Show results as interactive graph visualization
